    You can Special Summon 1 Dragon or Winged Beast monster from your hand in Defense
    Position, but for the rest of this turn, its effects (if any) are negated and
    it cannot be used as Link Material. You can only use each effect of "Dragunity
    Knight - Romulus" once per turn.'
